      evidencia: [W('Sulcus_(neuroanatomy)', 'A fissure is a deeper furrow that divides the brain into lobes, and also into the two hemispheres as the longitudinal fissure.'), W('Sulcus_(neuroanatomy)', 'A sulcus is a shallow groove that surrounds a gyrus or part of a gyrus.'), W('Longitudinal_fissure', 'Lying within it is a continuation of the dura mater (one of the meninges) called the falx cerebri.')],
